WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.700
[Marcelo Gramas logo]
30 years of gardens. No website.

00:02.700 --> 00:05.200
Before any pixel: 4 client interviews. 3 kinds of buyer.
One ask: show real work.

00:05.200 --> 00:09.400
marcelogramas.com.br. Live since October 2026.
[The homepage on desktop and on a phone. The cover image is an AI visualization, labeled on the site.]

00:09.400 --> 00:13.600
Proof first. Facts a client can check: since 1996, own team, named sod producer, area served.
Named public works. No star ratings.

00:13.600 --> 00:17.200
Services. Every service, a real job.
[Service cards, each with a captioned job photo.]

00:17.200 --> 00:20.400
From the team's own record. Real before and after.
[A walled backyard of bare earth, then covered in sod.]

00:20.400 --> 00:26.400
The quote form. 5 questions. The message writes itself.
Project type, place and size, ground today, installation, when to start, review, then WhatsApp.
[Message: Olá, Marcelo. Vim pelo site e gostaria de solicitar uma avaliação para orçamento.]

00:26.400 --> 00:29.200
First month live: 8 contacts through the site. 5 became new jobs.

00:29.200 --> 00:32.000
Marcelo Gramas. Garden and landscaping, Minas Gerais, Brazil.
Research and design by Matthias Schaefle. matthiasks.com/marcelo-gramas
